# Model files served at https://hypemuzik.com/models/<path> (nginx: location ^~ /models/).
#
# They live on the host in $MODELS_PATH (bind-mounted read-only into the
# container at /srv/models), not in this repo or the image. The deploy
# workflow's "Sync Model Files" step uploads any file that is missing on the
# server or has a different SHA-256, fetching it from the listed source and
# verifying it against the pinned hash first.
#
# <sha256>  <path under /models/>  <source url>

# Live stems in the Hype Muzik mobile app: Deezer's Spleeter 4-stem nets
# (weights MIT per the authors' JOSS paper, doi:10.21105/joss.02154), ONNX fp16
# export by Best-Practice/spleeter-4stems-onnx (Apache-2.0). The app pins the
# same hashes (lib/services/stems/stems_manifest.dart in the hype repo).
